WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.460
What will you miss most about Mossville?

2
00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:14.640
You can never get your childhood back once you leave it.

3
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:19.560
And it was just a good time for my . . . bringing us up,

4
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:29.080
being brought up all together with not only my sisters and brothers, but my neighbors.

5
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:34.400
We all stuck together and did things.

6
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.580
Can’t get that back, but I’m moving on.

7
00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:50.140
I’m just having dreams and visions of me walking again and I left Mossville . . . I went to Mossville.

8
00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:57.420
I was walking, and when I go back, I’m going to go back before I walk.

9
00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:06.660
But I’m just going to stick to the idea that I’ll be there once again walking and riding them horses.

10
00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.520
And I’m going to go to somebody’s house.

11
00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.300
Somebody going to have a horse.

12
00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:19.100
I’m going to ride through Mossville with my head in the air just running and hollering and riding that horse.
